          },
          "edge_type": "within"
        },
        "var_name": "c",
        "predicate": {
          "type": "Or",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "row"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "row"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "ymax"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "col"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "col"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "xmax"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "comment": "atom: some member cell sits on the world's edge (row/col at an extremity; ymax/xmax bound at eval). Perceptual."
    },
    {
      "name": "bbox_inside_play",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "MinOver",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "x"
                },
                "edge_type": "within"
              },
              "var_name": "c",
              "value": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "row"
              },
              "default": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "pminrow"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Lte",
            "a": {
              "type": "MaxOver",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "x"
                },
                "edge_type": "within"
              },
              "var_name": "c",
              "value": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "row"
              },
              "default": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "pmaxrow"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "MinOver",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "x"
                },
                "edge_type": "within"
              },
              "var_name": "c",
              "value": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "col"
              },
              "default": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "pmincol"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Lte",
            "a": {
              "type": "MaxOver",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "x"
                },
                "edge_type": "within"
              },
              "var_name": "c",
              "value": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "c"
                },
                "key": "col"
              },
              "default": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0
              }
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "pmaxcol"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": "atom: the region's bounding box sits inside the play area's bbox (play bbox bound at eval). Perceptual."
    },
    {
      "name": "background_region",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "Holds",
        "concept": "region_touches_boundary",
        "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "x"
        }
      },
      "comment": "the GROUND: a region that touches the world's boundary."
    },
    {
      "name": "bounded_area",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Holds",
            "concept": "is_region",
            "node": {
              "type": "Var",
              "name": "x"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Not",
            "arg": {
              "type": "Holds",
              "concept": "background_region",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "x"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": "a THING: is_region AND NOT background_region \u2014 a bounded interior area. The navigable area the avatar is in is the bounded_area; its bounds are impassable by default (testable, not required)."
    },
    {
      "name": "in_play",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "Holds",
        "concept": "bbox_inside_play",
        "node": {
          "type": "Var",
          "name": "x"
        }
      },
      "comment": "enclosed by the play area."
    },
    {
      "name": "cell_in_region",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "x"
              },
              "key": "row"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "y"
              },
              "key": "minrow"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Lte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "x"
              },
              "key": "row"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "y"
              },
              "key": "maxrow"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "x"
              },
              "key": "col"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "y"
              },
              "key": "mincol"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Lte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "x"
              },
              "key": "col"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "y"
              },
              "key": "maxcol"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "comment": "binary (cell x, region y): the cell's position falls within the region's measured bounds. The bounds-containment that lets a perceived figure become a region the figure/ground concepts evaluate over \u2014 composition, not a Python grouping or a new primitive."
    },
    {
      "name": "shares_edge",
      "domain": "space",
      "definition": {
        "type": "Eq",
        "a": {
          "type": "Plus",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "Abs",
              "arg": {
                "type": "Minus",
                "a": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "x"
                  },
                  "key": "row"
                },
                "b": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "y"
                  },
                  "key": "row"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "Abs",
              "arg": {
                "type": "Minus",
                "a": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "x"
                  },
                  "key": "col"
                },
                "b": {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "y"
                  },
                  "key": "col"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "b": {
          "type": "Lit",
          "value": 1
        }
      },
      "comment": "binary (cell x, cell y): the cells are adjacent (Manhattan distance 1, 4-connectivity). GESTALT PROXIMITY grounded \u2014 the order-N 'shared edges' that form the routable graph. Precise/local (diagonals do NOT share an edge), unlike bbox containment. Pairs with the figure/ground covering node: parts share edges, the covering node covers the whole."
    }
  ]
